blem "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $N=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,N-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nN-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(N-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-2-\\lambda )(-1-\\lambda )-3\\cdot 3 & =0 \\\\ 2+2\\lambda +\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-9 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+3\\lambda -7 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-76343/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cbf5fbb2-688a-5833-87b9-37229c8fb692"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76343"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-36771/selection/06d26a76e9e8af1acd2259bcd35665bd06d9fbf6bf8bea7e066c07c3bc525a86" :answer/id #uuid "577d4d32-d140-5e81-aa29-e46aa6dfde51" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -15=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36771/selection/38c00f4c3d2e2f13b7b5012265e30e41bf60ce3e6a5401ee8966a57344b9e651" :answer/id #uuid "4f4d1cb8-9b59-5e53-b5b1-894ef4d3df5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36771/selection/f2a3e1f2c9eac022bd586e7d5b0643136cfc31993508837ecaca3f444a6aef2b" :answer/id #uuid "6d09329f-8403-57f5-9d19-c8690f6e0bc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda +15=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36771/selection/dc37499437408ad54b1fbb8758c31cbf049b8bdb957ca98282f3917dd44def3e" :answer/id #uuid "1cbaf891-3cd8-55dd-a78f-1a5548b21e56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-15\\lambda +2=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36771/selection/2b38ea1bae0ca4b92b82f5df77ef604bb1f770d1e7f0b39d2